__pycache__/
.venv/
# Design scratch (mockups, raw renders, previews, personal screenshots) stays local;
# only the reproducible pipeline scripts and Codex prompts are tracked.
design/**
!design/
!design/art/
!design/art/*.py
!design/art/prompt-*.md
!design/mockups/
!design/mockups/brief.md
!design/mockups/dir-*.md
